"knowledge.card.ayatul_kursi.body" = "Recite it after every salah and before you sleep. A verse of protection, a night under Allah’s care.";
"knowledge.card.ayatul_kursi.source" = "Qur’an 2:255 · Sahih al-Bukhari 2311";

